            <div xml:id="d581">

                <pb facs="0609" n="493" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg493"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.51/439.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-11-30">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 30, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>French Government has officially recognized Dartiguenave Government. British
                    Chargé d’Affaires has instructions to recognize Dartiguenave Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Caperton</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
